    "text": "WBBJ\nwebsite\nHardin County, Tennessee\nSummer camp in Hardin County combines fun with education\nBy WBBJ 7 Eyewitness News Staff,\n6 hours agoSAVANNAH, Tenn. — The 3rd annual Hardin County Summer Learning Camp has almost come to an end. Students who have struggled this past year or may not have scored high enough on the state standardized test took advantage of the summer small group learning program to catch up with their peers.\n1",
